    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>Virtual routing block that splits a single input into multiple output ports. The demux block performs no computation - it is a wiring convenience used to fan out signals and organise connections.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
